{%- comment -%}
  The Rare Avenue - Quiet Luxury Multi-Tier Mobile Navigation (ADR 0022 / ADR 0030 Clean-Room)
  Fully compliant with Shopify Horizon theme standards. Zero proprietary external dependencies.
  Features:
    - 3-Tier Hierarchical Drill-down (Department -> Category -> Curated Brands)
    - Dedicated drop-down open and close indicators at each level (SVG Chevrons with smooth 180deg rotation)
    - 60fps CSS Grid natural-height expand/collapse transitions (no jumpy max-height)
    - Full touch targets (min 44px) for mobile usability
    - Pure Quiet Luxury aesthetic: Champagne Gold (#c9a876) accents & crisp typography
{%- endcomment -%}

